<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/msa@/~cl_12__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "dengan memotong subseksyen (2); dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/msa@/~cl_12__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/msa@/~cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/msa@> .
