<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/msa@/~cl_47> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "47" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/64/msa@> .
